  "_note_no_door_lock_entry": "No DOOR_LOCK_TRANSCEIVER|CHANNEL_OPERATION_MODE key exists, qualified or not, and none of IGNORE_DOOR_OPEN / SKIP_HOLD_TIME_OPENING / SKIP_RELOCK_DELAY_CLOSING / SKIP_HOLD_TIME_OPENING_RELOCK_DELAY_CLOSING appears anywhere in the string table or the language files. The ACCELERATION_TRANSCEIVER entries name FLAT_DECT, not the TILT_DETECTION / TILT_AND_MOTION_DETECTION the device reports, so channel 2 is uncovered too.",
  "_note_stringtable_keys_unresolvable": "The stringtable_de.txt values are ${stringTable...} placeholders, and the four CHANNEL_OPERATION_MODE ones (…ChannelOperationModeOff / …AnyMotion / …Flat, stringTableKeyTransceiverChannelOperationMode) are absent from translate.lang.stringtable.js in both locales — so even the covered tokens have no resolvable wording on this firmware.",
  "ccu_vocabulary_for_the_concepts": {
