 "daemon_help_text_defect": {
  "_finding": "The help text the daemon renders for CHANNEL_OPERATION_MODE on every one of these channels is a radiator-thermostat text: 'Durch den Flüsterbetrieb fahren die Heizkörperthermostate langsamer und damit leiser.' That is where the reported 'Flüsterbetrieb' came from — it was never a value label.",
  "_cause": "Translations.ParameterHelp is keyed by parameter name alone. Measured on the embedded v0.1.3 extract: 167 help entries for locale de, of which 0 are channel-type-qualified. The daemon therefore cannot attribute a help text to a channel type at all.",
  "_owner_decision_2026-09-07": "Belongs upstream in openccu-data / go-openccu-data, not in the daemon."
 }
}